    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962750281314304
    m_Localized: Not to be confused with blueberries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962785735766016
    m_Localized: Technically edible, which is why it's here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962913997582336
    m_Localized: This most likely violates the Geneva Convention or something like
      that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962951779872768
    m_Localized: At least it's not balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963066632499200
    m_Localized: When consumed in buckets, it removes all negative effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962979168677888
    m_Localized: Bread is the head of everything, but as for flour... I didn't come
      up with it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963037930876928
    m_Localized: Don't ask whose meat this is, we have no idea ourselves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963630908993536
    m_Localized: Aliens love to draw on this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963097305444352
    m_Localized: It doesn't grow on palm trees or in cans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962833924124672
    m_Localized: We do NOT use Oompa-Loompas as cheap labor. Honestly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963435865468928
    m_Localized: Someday we'll get in trouble for national stereotypes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963143497314304
    m_Localized: Oh yes, Belarus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963550621626368
    m_Localized: It's worth starting a space-scale war. Purchased individually
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963615608172544
    m_Localized: Not suitable for throwing at bad comedians (especially us)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963005865422848
    m_Localized: If life gives you lemons, sell them to us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962861908520960
    m_Localized: The taste of hell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963466278367232
    m_Localized: Former residents of Bikini Top
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15963580707368960
    m_Localized: No more than five grams per day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
